1
00:00:00,246 --> 00:00:03,126
(Sheldon:)Now, here's your tartar sauce.
I also brought you salsa.

2
00:00:03,291 --> 00:00:07,001
(Sheldon:)A little unconventional,
but I think you'll like it. It's zingy.

3
00:00:08,212 --> 00:00:12,802
(Sheldon:)And for you, Factory Burrito Grande,
no cheese, no sour cream...

4
00:00:12,967 --> 00:00:15,807
(Sheldon:)...no ugly consequences
from your lactose intolerance.

5
00:00:17,055 --> 00:00:18,635
[SPEAKS IN FRENCH]

6
00:00:18,806 --> 00:00:20,596
(Leonard:)Hang on.

7
00:00:21,059 --> 00:00:22,979
(Leonard:)-Black beans, not pinto beans?
-Yes.

8
00:00:23,144 --> 00:00:26,984
-Guacamole? No cilantro? Lettuce?
-Yep.

9
00:00:27,148 --> 00:00:29,108
-Understand why I'm doing this?
-I do.

10
00:00:29,275 --> 00:00:31,155
(Leonard:)That'll be all.

11
00:00:33,321 --> 00:00:34,451
(Leonard:)That was fun.

12
00:00:34,614 --> 00:00:36,364
[ALL LAUGH]

13
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,330
(Raj:)How long can he keep this up?

14
00:00:38,534 --> 00:00:41,664
(Leonard:)I heard about this professor
who melted down, bought a van...

15
00:00:41,829 --> 00:00:44,169
(Leonard:)...spent the rest of his life
as a dog groomer.

16
00:00:44,332 --> 00:00:46,002
(Raj:)Never went back to the university?

17
00:00:46,167 --> 00:00:49,167
(Leonard:)Only to shampoo
Professor Shamburg's shih tzu.

18
00:00:50,588 --> 00:00:52,298
(Raj:)Sheesh.

19
00:00:54,092 --> 00:00:57,682
You know, I bet if we all chipped in,
we could buy Sheldon a van.

20
00:00:57,845 --> 00:00:59,345
(Raj:)But he's afraid of dogs.

21
00:00:59,555 --> 00:01:03,025
(Leonard:)Yeah. That's the only thing wrong
with that plan.

